  "prefLabel": "Lot 502.01 Definition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 502.01 Definition. The following definitions shall apply to this chapter:\n\n(a) \"Commission\" means the New Hampshire lottery and gaming commission; and\n\n(b) “Prize winner” means the person(s) holding a signed or validated lottery ticket sold by the commission.\n\nSource. #7094, eff 9-15-99; ss by #8898, eff 9-15-07; ss by #10987, eff 12-3-15; ss by #14530, eff 3-4-26, EXPIRES: 3-4-36",
